\newlabel{fig:system}{{1}{2}{\textbf {\sys {} architecture.} (1)~$\sigma _u$ holds one RO trunk; \texttt {fork} aliases it in $O(1)$; LCP binds the winner. (2)~Cost-ordered prefill pruning admits work by $G/C$, then rejects each residual at the first decisive stage: block-hash probe, draft score, kernel prefix, miss-tail prefill, and a gated \texttt {insert}. (3)~Prefill and decode run as separate instances. Pruning removes blocks at arbitrary positions (dashed), rather than as a suffix; only surviving KV is inserted, so fan-out time falls from $162$\,ms under stock ship-all P/D to $31.4$\,ms. After abort the live occupancy is the spine $M_{\mathrm {spine}}$; the same $8$\,GiB pool then admits $76{\to }103$ sessions ($+35.5\%$ tok/s)}{figure.1}{}}
\newlabel{fig:system@cref}{{[figure][1][]1}{[1][1][]2}{}{}{}}
