\newlabel{fig:pool}{{2}{5}{\textbf {Context-tree page pool.} \texttt {fork} aliases the trunk in $O(1)$ and allocates only $\rho $~\textcircled {1}--\textcircled {3}. $H$ publishes full committed blocks~\textcircled {4}\textcircled {6}. \texttt {abort} returns residual frames only, so live occupancy is the spine $M_{\mathrm {spine}}{=}b(L{+}\ell _\star )$~\textcircled {5}\textcircled {7}}{figure.2}{}}
